## Active

> The **only** working set. Every row's `Status` is exactly `open` (unscheduled,
> pickable) or `wip S##` (scheduled / in progress in that sprint) — nothing else.
> Sort by priority (P0 first); `wip` rows naturally cluster by their sprint.
> Terminal rows (`done S##` / `wontfix` / `superseded-by B###`) do **not** live
> here — they are swept to the cold archive (`scripts/backlog.sh sweep`).

| ID | Type | Title | Pri | Size | Status |
|----|------|-------|-----|------|--------|
| B001 | feat | **Example open row** — what it does in ≤100 chars | P1 | M | open |
| B002 | bug | **Example scheduled row** — short symptom | P2 | S | wip S01 |

