## Follow-ups

> Work surfaced by a retro that didn't fit its original scope (formerly the
> separate `FOLLOWUPS.md`). `/retro` **appends** here at sprint close; `/work`
> **reads** here before picking the next task and asks whether any open item is
> now in scope. `F####` IDs serialize through the integration base — see
> [`NAMING.md`](./NAMING.md) for the full convention. Columns: `ID · From ·
> Item · Type · Priority · Opened · Owner · Status`. Follow-up status is its own
> lifecycle: `open | in-progress | consumed-by:<task-id> | wont-do (reason)`.

